  "chassis": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - THE BODY BETWEEN THE EARS. The drawing gives 483.00 over the ears and 440.00 for the cover; the backbone runs flat into the ears, 21.5 mm each, which are not drawn. Height 51.00 is the cover, dimensioned on the front view, and the end view measures 51.7 across the cover; the ears are 43.60 and the backbone 44, centred. The FS product page height of 44.45 is the rack unit, not the part. Depth 113.3 is the end view overall, cover included, and the spec table states 113.3 and 106; 106 is the backbone to the finger tips on the plan."
