   "note": "FIGURES FROM THE VENDOR DRAWING. The FS Horizontal Cable Managers with Finger Duct datasheet (steel, portal id 6867) carries a technical drawing of CMH-SFDS1U: the back, a plan, an end view and the front, with dimensions in millimetres. The embedded image (1228 x 770) is 1.567 px/mm across the 483 and the 440, 1.566 down the 106 and 1.571 down the 113.3: it is orthographic and carries geometry to about a millimetre. The renders of #220085 on the FS product page are the second reading, one of them a straight-on view of the back."
